", "title": "collective memory"}, {"id": "5252ee07-4be1-48de-9697-ac65d6d98f97", "type": "concept", "title": "commemoration"}, {"id": "4be0560d-a924-473a-919a-ffb3dbb93082", "type": "concept", "title": "anniversary"}, {"id": "649710b1-6651-4d0c-8703-fc6efad151fd", "type": "concept", "title": "tradition"}, {"id": "f8414e50-309c-4e4b-bbf0-e4137a8b9959", "type": "concept", "title": "forgetting"}, {"id": "45cb86a1-6ec9-40f3-8db6-b17ac8d279d4", "type": "concept", "title": "memory politics"}], "description": "Students learn how memory differs from history and why both matter."}, {"id": "8fe574f8-4900-43f7-b022-d2d7b6e3ff37", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Trauma and testimony", "children": [{"id": "f5457106-ac1b-4cfa-88d7-8c099274f287", "type": "concept", "title": "trauma"}, {"id": "0b351461-458e-441d-8605-ddcdb8f128bd", "type": "concept", "title": "testimony"}, {"id": "cf35a6fc-f8a1-4548-b888-714f7222ebfb", "type": "concept", "title": "survivor account"}, {"id": "483e800e-8af2-4707-af08-0a7aab452688", "type": "concept", "title": "Holocaust memory"}, {"id": "7957f912-e0bf-4dca-b7a9-e0a4c07c22df", "type": "concept", "title": "violence"}, {"id": "12e66993-a644-4754-bd9f-fbf4253f43bc", "type": "concept", "title": "silence"}, {"id": "26d06f0a-c726-4b39-a1f7-6ba9abe0fcfc", "type": "concept", "title": "secondary witnessing"}, {"id": "f06c7836-4a2a-41a2-88f2-6f65a3a96b7d", "type": "concept", "title": "ethics of representation"}], "description": "This subtopic examines difficult histories and ethical representation."}, {"id": "5e8f90d3-1d92-4e87-93a6-a00bf4657b7e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Public history", "children": [{"id": "1f510c37-63a4-4394-a976-77ff1a5a86d3", "type": "concept", "title": "museum"}, {"id": "cf55f41b-c99a-49e2-957d-79b1b25be327", "type": "concept", "title": "monument"}, {"id": "cc428031-d06f-4b8b-a685-04976559d2e4", "type": "concept", "title": "heritage"}, {"id": "46614496-9139-4546-842b-adb71fe3262d", "type": "concept", "title": "interpretive label"}, {"i